<a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a><main class="wrap inner-page academy-main" id="main-content"><section class="academy-page-hero"><div class="academy-breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href='/resources'>Explore MBK</a></div><div class="academy-kicker">contact <span> / MBK GLOBAL</span></div><h1 class="page-title">Got something in <em>mind?</em></h1><p class="page-intro">Have a project idea, want to collaborate, or just want to connect? Choose the channel that works for you.</p></section><p class="eyebrow">CONTACT / 06</p><div class="contact-layout"><div class="contact-options"><a href="mailto:Bakhtawark085@gmail.com"><small>EMAIL</small><b>Bakhtawark085@gmail.com</b><span>↗</span></a><a href="https://wa.me/923200276941" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><small>WHATSAPP</small><b>+92 320 0276941</b><span>↗</span></a><a href="https://github.com/Muhammad-Bakhtawar-Khan" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><small>CODE / PROJECTS</small><b>GitHub profile</b><span>↗</span></a><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/muhammad-bakhtawar-khan-43b02931b" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><small>PROFESSIONAL</small><b>LinkedIn</b><span>↗</span></a></div><div class="contact-note"><span class="note-star">✳</span><h2 id="section-1">Good work starts with a clear conversation.</h2><p>Tell me what you’re trying to build, what problem it solves and what stage you’re at. I’ll get back to you through the channel you choose.</p><p class="muted">Based in Pakistan · Open to remote collaboration</p></div></div><section class="section wrap project-form-section" id="project-enquiry"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">PROJECT ENQUIRY / WHATSAPP</p><h2 id="section-2">Tell me about <em>your idea.</em></h2><p class="faq-intro">Fill in the details below. Your WhatsApp message will open with the information ready to send.</p></div></div><form class="project-form" id="whatsappProjectForm"><div class="form-grid"><label>Your name *<input autocomplete="name" name="name" placeholder="Enter your name" required></label><label>WhatsApp / phone *<input autocomplete="tel" name="phone" placeholder="Your contact number" required></label><label>Email address<input autocomplete="email" name="email" placeholder="you@example.com" type="email"></label><label>Service you need *<select name="service" required><option value="">Choose a service</option><option>Website design / development</option><option>Portfolio or landing page</option><option>React / frontend development</option><option>API integration</option><option>AI tools / automation</option><option>WhatsApp bot</option><option>Technical SEO</option><option>UI/UX or graphic design</option><option>Other / not sure yet</option></select></label><label>Estimated budget<select name="budget"><option value="Not specified">Prefer to discuss</option><option>Under $100</option><option>$100–$300</option><option>$300–$700</option><option>$700+</option><option>To be discussed</option></select></label><label>Preferred timeline<select name="timeline"><option value="Flexible">Flexible</option><option>As soon as possible</option><option>Within 2 weeks</option><option>Within a month</option><option>Specific date to discuss</option></select></label><label class="form-full">Project details *<textarea name="details" placeholder="What do you want to build? Mention key features, references or goals." required rows="5"></textarea></label></div><button class="button button-primary form-submit" type="submit">Send details on WhatsApp ↗</button><p class="form-privacy">Your details are placed into a WhatsApp message. Nothing is sent until you press Send in WhatsApp.</p><p aria-live="polite" class="form-success" hidden id="formSuccess" role="status">Thank you! Your project details are ready in WhatsApp. Please press Send there to complete your enquiry.</p></form></section>
